  "description": "Optimizely Data Platform (ODP) integration for Optimizely CMS 12. Provides visitor group criteria based on real-time ODP audiences with scheduled audience caching, encrypted cookie-based tracking, and a diagnostic API.",
  "id": "Opti.ODP",
